{"2292370": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "PlayM2M", "steam_appid": 2292370, "required_age": 0, "is_free": true, "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">           <span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2292370/extras/2e38c209cf139f578539954a780f5559.webp?t=1787477616\" width=734 height=39 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>PlayM2M is a developed fantasy MMORPG featuring an open world, fast-paced combat, mount collection, and deep character progression. Built on a custom game engine, the game welcomes players daily to explore the continent of Anathen, where the dynastys of Rasan, Teven and Solon clash in an ongoing power struggle.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2292370/extras/689f203052c0a3be3c7f8754bccf073c.poster.avif?t=1787477616\" width=720 height=244 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2292370/extras/689f203052c0a3be3c7f8754bccf073c.webm?t=1787477616\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2292370/extras/689f203052c0a3be3c7f8754bccf073c.mp4?t=1787477616\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Key Features</strong></h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Four playable classes representing Darkness and Light!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Choose from four distinct classes:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Dorhan (Guardian of Darkness, Keeper of Light)</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Skogr (Shadow Keeper, Hunter of Light)</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Petrun (Lord of Darkness, Guardian of Light)</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Wizard (Sorcerer of Darkness, Priest of Light)</strong></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each class offers unique playstyles, stat builds, and a dedicated skill tree.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2292370/extras/dc4c8d5548b58c26576854a9739fc581.poster.avif?t=1787477616\" width=720 height=274 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2292370/extras/dc4c8d5548b58c26576854a9739fc581.webm?t=1787477616\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2292370/extras/dc4c8d5548b58c26576854a9739fc581.mp4?t=1787477616\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Real-Time, Dynamic Combat System</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fast and visually striking melee and magic attacks.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >PvE and PvP modes.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Ability combos, buffs, debuffs, and area-of-effect spells.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Specialization-based combat variations<strong> </strong><br> <br><strong> </strong></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2292370/extras/c2ca5923293638057f84c13ac2977538.poster.avif?t=1787477616\" width=680 height=176 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2292370/extras/c2ca5923293638057f84c13ac2977538.webm?t=1787477616\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2292370/extras/c2ca5923293638057f84c13ac2977538.mp4?t=1787477616\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Create guilds and fight together. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Meet players from all over the world. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Conquer mysterious worlds with unique mounts and uncover secrets! </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Have an unforgettable MMORPG experience.<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2292370/extras/701ab5a97f3695c6e8458b5a5e181a30.poster.avif?t=1787477616\" width=720 height=250 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2292370/extras/701ab5a97f3695c6e8458b5a5e181a30.webm?t=1787477616\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2292370/extras/701ab5a97f3695c6e8458b5a5e181a30.mp4?t=1787477616\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><strong>Download PlayM2M now and start a fantastic adventure! </strong></p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>What Is PlayM2M ?</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >PlayM2M  is a brand new MMORPG that takes you on an adventure in a fantasy world. In this enchanting game you will discover the secrets of magic and progress on your journey to become a true master. </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2292370/extras/3b75a8c5e3ab5dd471b93969f5367d90.poster.avif?t=1787477616\" width=720 height=274 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2292370/extras/3b75a8c5e3ab5dd471b93969f5367d90.webm?t=1787477616\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2292370/extras/3b75a8c5e3ab5dd471b93969f5367d90.mp4?t=1787477616\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Open World and Questing</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A freely explorable fantasy world with multiple regions</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Choose your kingdom at the start of the game</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Beginner tutorial quests teaching movement, combat, equipment, and mount usage</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Regular content updates and expanding world features</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Mount  Progression</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Account-wide bonuses that apply to all characters</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Rare, event-exclusive mounts</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2292370/extras/a7f8f122509d0ab2a9df899d653a6bd5.poster.avif?t=1787477616\" width=668 height=206 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2292370/extras/a7f8f122509d0ab2a9df899d653a6bd5.webm?t=1787477616\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2292370/extras/a7f8f122509d0ab2a9df899d653a6bd5.mp4?t=1787477616\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Equipment and Enhancement</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Stone socketing, forging, and crafting systems</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Strengthening equipment and adding new attributes</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Frequent boss and dungeon rewards</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2292370/extras/b536bcab061941df741e9034137acfc8.poster.avif?t=1787477616\" width=720 height=274 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2292370/extras/b536bcab061941df741e9034137acfc8.webm?t=1787477616\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2292370/extras/b536bcab061941df741e9034137acfc8.mp4?t=1787477616\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Economy and Marketplace</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Auction</strong> <strong>House</strong> serves as the central marketplace for player-to-player trading</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A fully community-driven economy based on supply and demand</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>PvE Content</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Diverse monsters across the world</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dungeons (runs) with varying difficulty</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >World bosses and minibosses</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Seasonal events with unique rewards</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Play As You Like</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fight, craft, steal, siege or explore and combine different types of armor, weapons and abilities and unique spells to create your own playstyle. In an ever-growing, persistent world of PlayM2M the choice is yours and yours alone. </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Tell Your story</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Discover the secrets of Tharganir as you journey through the lost and mysterious lands of Anathen to reclaim your soul and save the world from Nasfary, god of Hell. Experience one of the epic stories of the four great dynasties with others or alone, in whatever order you choose, anywhere in the vast world. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" a