t, steal, siege or explore and combine different types of armor, weapons and abilities and unique spells to create your own playstyle. In an ever-growing, persistent world of PlayM2M the choice is yours and yours alone. </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Tell Your story</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Discover the secrets of Tharganir as you journey through the lost and mysterious lands of Anathen to reclaim your soul and save the world from Nasfary, god of Hell. Experience one of the epic stories of the four great dynasties with others or alone, in whatever order you choose, anywhere in the vast world. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2292370/extras/9ff19437ae9a2238446e28b8eadb048e.poster.avif?t=1787477616\" width=720 height=274 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2292370/extras/9ff19437ae9a2238446e28b8eadb048e.webm?t=1787477616\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2292370/extras/9ff19437ae9a2238446e28b8eadb048e.mp4?t=1787477616\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>A Massively Multiplayer RPG</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Complete quests with friends, join fellow adventurers to explore dangerous, monster-filled dungeons, or take part in epic PvP battles with hundreds of other players.</p>", "short_description": "A free-to-play mythological fantasy MMORPG set in the mysterious world of Arasina, where you battle against the dark forces rising once more. Choose your side and fight legendary creatures! Uncover the secret of the demons.", "supported_languages": "English<strong>*</strong>, Hungarian, Turkish, German, Spanish - Spain, Czech, French, Italian, Polish, Portuguese - Portugal, Romanian<br><strong>*</strong>languages with full audio sup